<SPT><TTL>ADAS</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The Automated Data Acquisition System (ADAS) will be measured on a lump sum basis.  This does not include the 
individual instruments listed in the prior paragraph.  This item includes all equipment, supplies, materials, 
and programming/configuration necessary for a fully functional ADAS which polls and communicates successfully 
with those data collection devices identified separately above.  This item includes, but is not limited to, the 
following components:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Enclosures and mounts.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Data loggers.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>LMU/RMU.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>RIO.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Multiplexer.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Power.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Software.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Transient voltage surge suppressors.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Communication hardware and services.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
